  "text": "에대해사실이라고믿게됨 . > 기억은완벽하지않다. Participant Observation : A methodology that involves the observation of a group by participating. 직접참여해서관찰생물학자들이고릴라 HOSS 들어가 HHS. 범죄학자들이감옥과죄수에관해 AAS B(Stanford) East 에서실제로살면서관찰을함 . Case Study or life histroy : A qualitative, case study method of examining a subject's life history. Unobtrusive Measures : Nonreactive methods of data gathering in which the subjects are unaware that they are being studied. 대상이관측당하고있는지모르는상태로관찰 c.f. Simulation: attempt to mimic or imitate a more complex social reality (not widely-adopted). Validity, Reliability, Triangulation *Validity : the accuracy of measurement 측정이정확하게되었는가? *Reliability : the consistency or stability of measurement 측정된것이믿을만한가? 일반적으로적용가능한가? *Triangulation : the use of multiple research methods 여러개의사용하는것.",
